	>
PHYLUP,	CLA
	TAD LINENO	/PRINT INFO FOR PHYSICAL LINE 'LINENO'
	JMS I (SET
	LCBTAB
	CDF DDCFLD
	LCBSIZ
	IFNDEF SKIMP <
	JMS I (GET	/GET FIELD OF ERROR TABLE
	LCBFLD
